*> Acceptance test US9-2 (spec 002 FR-024, FR-025, FR-028; SC-005; 13 sections 3.8, 3.9; builtin-ui-art 4.13.4): the recipe book. Recipe Book
*> Add (05b 0x4B), Remove (0x4C) and Settings (0x4D) fill the client's book; the panel beside the inventory screen lists the collections of the
*> selected tab that fit the 2 x 2 grid (a group is one collection), marks the craftable ones from the inventory, has the tabs (Search always, the
*> others only with recipes), the filter, the search box and the page arrows at the places of 4.13.4; clicking a cell sends Recipe Book Seen
*> Recipe (a highlighted recipe) and Place Recipe (container 0, display id, use max = Shift); the book button and the filter send Recipe Book
*> Change Settings; a Recipe Book Add with the notification flag shows the toast "New Recipe(s) Unlocked!" for 5 seconds.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-F2US9-RECIPE-BOOK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CLSTATE.
 COPY CLCONST.
 COPY CCSHIM.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY PROTO REPLACING LEADING ==PB-== BY ==XB-==.
 01 WS-SERVER              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CONN                BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-THRESHOLD           BINARY-LONG VALUE -1.
 01 WS-PATH                PIC X(256).
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-TYPED              PIC X(64).
 01 WS-TEXTS               PIC X(1024).
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-K                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-N                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E                   PIC Z(8)9.
 01 WS-FOUND               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ARG                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ACTION              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PACKET              BINARY-LONG VALUE 75.
 01 WS-READY               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 65536.
 01 WS-REPLACE             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-COUNT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROWS.
    05 FILLER PIC X(18) VALUE "001100002240102113".
    05 FILLER PIC X(18) VALUE "002000060020304110".
    05 FILLER PIC X(18) VALUE "003000060010504110".
    05 FILLER PIC X(18) VALUE "004101003390107110".
    05 FILLER PIC X(18) VALUE "005002000010110110".
    05 FILLER PIC X(18) VALUE "006204000020101110".
 01 WS-ROW-TABLE REDEFINES WS-ROWS.
    05 WS-ROW OCCURS 6 TIMES.
       10 WS-R-ID          PIC 999.
       10 WS-R-TYPE        PIC 9.
       10 WS-R-CAT         PIC 99.
       10 WS-R-GROUP       PIC 99.
       10 WS-R-W           PIC 9.
       10 WS-R-H           PIC 9.
       10 WS-R-SLOTS       PIC 9.
       10 WS-R-ING         PIC 99.
       10 WS-R-RES         PIC 99.
       10 WS-R-RC          PIC 9.
       10 WS-R-REQ         PIC 9.
       10 WS-R-FLAGS       PIC 9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "TEST-PLAY" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-SERVER
     MOVE 640 TO IN-WIN-W
     MOVE 480 TO IN-WIN-H
     CALL "TEST-STEP" USING CLIENT-STATE
*>   Inventory: 8 x item 1 and 1 x item 3.
     MOVE 8 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(10)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(10)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(11)
     MOVE 3 TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(11)

*>   ---- Recipe Book Add ----
     MOVE 6 TO WS-COUNT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-REPLACE
     PERFORM FEED-ROWS
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 Recipe Book Add keeps the 6 entries in order" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE "6 1 2 3 4 5 6" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE RK-COUNT TO WS-E
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > RK-COUNT
         MOVE RK-ID(WS-I) TO WS-E
         STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 entry 1 is shaped 2x2 of building blocks, highlighted, with requirements; entry 4 is shaped 3x3 redstone" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 122011 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = RK-TYPE(1) * 100000 + RK-WIDTH(1) * 10000 + RK-HEIGHT(1) * 1000 + RK-CATEGORY(1) * 100
         + RK-HIGHLIGHT(1) * 10 + RK-REQ-PRESENT(1)
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 13310 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = RK-TYPE(4) * 10000 + RK-WIDTH(4) * 1000 + RK-HEIGHT(4) * 100 + RK-CATEGORY(4) * 10
         + RK-HIGHLIGHT(4)
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the group of entries 2 and 3 is one collection headed by entry 2 (after the first frame)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE RK-HEAD(3) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   ---- Remove, Replace, Settings ----
     MOVE "contract/fixtures/wire/play-s2c-4c-recipe-book-remove.hex" TO WS-PATH
     CALL "TEST-FEED" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-CONN WS-PATH
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 Recipe Book Remove of the display ids 0, 1 and 300 removes entry 1 only: 5 left" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 5002 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = RK-COUNT * 1000 + RK-ID(1)
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "contract/fixtures/wire/play-s2c-4b-recipe-book-add-standard-replace-empty.hex" TO WS-PATH
     CALL "TEST-FEED" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-CONN WS-PATH
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 Recipe Book Add with Replace and no entries empties the book" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RK-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 6 TO WS-COUNT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-REPLACE
     PERFORM FEED-ROWS
     MOVE "contract/fixtures/wire/play-s2c-4d-recipe-book-settings.hex" TO WS-PATH
     CALL "TEST-FEED" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-CONN WS-PATH
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 Recipe Book Settings: crafting open, not filtering; blast furnace open and filtering" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "1 0 1 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING RK-OPEN(1) " " RK-FILTERING(1) " " RK-OPEN(3) " " RK-FILTERING(3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   ---- the panel beside the inventory screen ----
     MOVE CC-KEY-E TO WS-KEY
     CALL "TEST-KEY" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-KEY
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-N
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
         IF SM-W-KIND(WS-I) = WK-SHEET AND SM-W-ARG(WS-I) = GSP-SHEET-BOOK
             COMPUTE WS-N = SM-W-X(WS-I) * 1000000 + SM-W-Y(WS-I) * 1000 + SM-W-W(WS-I)
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the panel is the 147-wide recipe book sheet at (86, 37) of the 320 x 240 GUI" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 86037147 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE WS-N TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the Search tab lists 3 cells: entry 1, the collection of entries 2 and 3, entry 5 (entry 4 needs 3x3)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RK-CELL-COUNT TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the cell slots 201 to 203 are 25 x 25 at (97, 68), (122, 68), (147, 68)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 201 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 203
         PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
             IF SM-W-KIND(WS-I) = WK-SLOT AND SM-W-ARG(WS-I) = WS-K
                 MOVE SM-W-W(WS-I) TO WS-E
                 STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
                 MOVE SM-W-X(WS-I) TO WS-E
                 STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) "@" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
                 MOVE SM-W-Y(WS-I) TO WS-E
                 STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
             END-IF
         END-PERFORM
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "25@97,68 25@122,68 25@147,68" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 craftable cells (entries 1 and 5) show the craftable slot sprite, the collection of 2 and 3 the uncraftable one" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "23 24 23" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 201 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > 203
         PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
             IF SM-W-KIND(WS-I) = WK-SLOT AND SM-W-ARG(WS-I) = WS-K
                 MOVE SM-W-ARG(WS-I - 1) TO WS-E
                 STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
             END-IF
         END-PERFORM
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   The tabs: Search, Equipment (entry 5) and Building Blocks (entries 1 to 3); Misc and Redstone have nothing for a 2 x 2 grid.
     MOVE 0 TO WS-N
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
         IF SM-W-KIND(WS-I) = WK-IMAGE AND SM-W-ACTION(WS-I) = ACT-RB-TAB
             MOVE SM-W-ARG(WS-I) TO WS-E
             STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
             MOVE SM-W-X(WS-I) TO WS-E
             STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) "@" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
             MOVE SM-W-Y(WS-I) TO WS-E
             STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 three tabs at x 54 (selected, 2 further left), 56, 56 and y 40, 67, 94: Search, Equipment, Building" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "1@54,40 2@56,67 3@56,94" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
         IF SM-W-KIND(WS-I) = WK-IMAGE AND (SM-W-ACTION(WS-I) = ACT-RB-FILTER OR SM-W-ACTION(WS-I) = ACT-RB-BOOK)
             MOVE SM-W-SPRITE(WS-I) TO WS-E
             STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
             MOVE SM-W-X(WS-I) TO WS-E
             STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) "@" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
             MOVE SM-W-Y(WS-I) TO WS-E
             STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the book button (sprite 16) at (176, 98) and the filter button (sprite 20) at (196, 49)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "16@176,98 20@196,49" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   ---- clicks ----
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD
     MOVE ACT-RB-CELL TO WS-ACTION
     MOVE 201 TO WS-ARG
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 clicking cell 1 (highlighted entry 1) sends Seen Recipe 1 then Place Recipe container 0, id 1, use max false" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "3001 27000100" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the highlight of entry 1 is gone after it was seen" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RK-HIGHLIGHT(1) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE CC-MOD-SHIFT TO IN-MODS
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     MOVE 0 TO IN-MODS
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 a Shift-click sends Place Recipe only (no Seen again), use max true" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "27000101" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*>   Filter: craftable only.
     MOVE ACT-RB-FILTER TO WS-ACTION
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ARG
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the filter sends Change Settings (crafting, open, filtering) and keeps the 2 craftable cells" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "2f000101 cells 2" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE RK-CELL-COUNT TO WS-E
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) " cells " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD
*>   Tabs.
     MOVE ACT-RB-TAB TO WS-ACTION
     MOVE 2 TO WS-ARG
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the Equipment tab shows 1 cell (entry 5)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1005 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = RK-CELL-COUNT * 1000 + RK-ID(RK-CELL-ROW(1))
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-ARG
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
*>   Search.
     MOVE ACT-RB-SEARCH TO WS-ACTION
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ARG
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     MOVE "pry" TO WS-TYPED
     MOVE 3 TO WS-N
     CALL "TEST-TYPE" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-TYPED WS-N
     MOVE CC-KEY-E TO WS-KEY
     CALL "TEST-KEY" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-KEY
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 typing pry in the search box lists the one recipe whose result is the pry bar; E does not close the screen" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-EXPECTED TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "pry 1 6" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE RK-CELL-COUNT TO WS-E
     STRING RK-SEARCH(1:RK-SEARCH-LENGTH) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE SM-SCREEN TO WS-E
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE CC-KEY-BACKSPACE TO WS-KEY
     CALL "TEST-KEY" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-KEY
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 Backspace removes the last character of the search text" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "pr" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE RK-SEARCH(1:RK-SEARCH-LENGTH) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   ---- the book button ----
     MOVE ACT-RB-BOOK TO WS-ACTION
     MOVE 0 TO WS-ARG
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     CALL "TEST-SERVER-READ-HEX" USING WS-SERVER WS-TEXT WS-THRESHOLD
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 0 TO WS-N
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > SM-WIDGET-COUNT
         IF SM-W-KIND(WS-I) = WK-SHEET AND SM-W-ARG(WS-I) = GSP-SHEET-BOOK
             ADD 1 TO WS-N
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the book button closes the panel and sends Change Settings (crafting, closed, filtering)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "2f000000 sheets 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-N TO WS-E
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) " sheets " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   ---- pages: 45 collections, 20 a page ----
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     MOVE 45 TO WS-COUNT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-REPLACE
     PERFORM FEED-MANY
     MOVE 1 TO RK-TAB
     MOVE SPACES TO RK-SEARCH
     MOVE 0 TO RK-SEARCH-LENGTH RK-FILTERING(1)
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE ACT-RB-PAGE TO WS-ACTION
     MOVE 2 TO WS-ARG
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 45 collections are 3 pages: page 1 shows 20 cells" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 3020 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = RK-PAGES * 1000 + RK-CELL-COUNT
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     CALL "SCREEN-BUILD" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the next-page arrow twice shows page 3 with 5 cells and its label 3/3" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-EXPECTED TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "3 5 3/3" TO TL-EXPECTED
     CALL "TEST-SCREEN-TEXTS" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-TEXTS
     MOVE RK-PAGE TO WS-E
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) " " DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE RK-CELL-COUNT TO WS-E
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E) " " DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE 0 TO WS-N
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 1000
         IF WS-TEXTS(WS-I:3) = "3/3" AND WS-N = 0
             MOVE 1 TO WS-N
             STRING FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) " 3/3" DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(TL-OBSERVED) TO WS-TEXT
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE WS-TEXT TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-ARG
     CALL "TEST-CLICK" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-ACTION WS-ARG WS-FOUND
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the previous-page arrow goes back to page 2" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 2 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE RK-PAGE TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT

*>   ---- the toast ----
     CALL "TEST-STEP" USING CLIENT-STATE
     MOVE 1 TO WS-COUNT
     MOVE 0 TO WS-REPLACE
     PERFORM FEED-ROWS
     CALL "TEST-STEP" USING CLIENT-STATE
     CALL "TEST-SCREEN-TEXTS" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-TEXTS
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 an Add with the notification flag shows the toast title" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 1000
         IF WS-TEXTS(WS-I:23) = "New Recipe(s) Unlocked!"
             MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 121 TO WS-N
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-N
     CALL "TEST-SCREEN-TEXTS" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-TEXTS
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US9-2 the toast is gone after 5 seconds" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE 0 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 1000
         IF WS-TEXTS(WS-I:23) = "New Recipe(s) Unlocked!"
             MOVE 1 TO TL-OBSERVED-N
         END-IF
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.

 FEED-ROWS.
     IF WS-READY = 0
         CALL "PB-INIT" USING XB-BUFFER WS-CAPACITY
         MOVE 1 TO WS-READY
     END-IF
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING XB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING XB-BUFFER WS-COUNT
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > WS-COUNT
         MOVE FUNCTION MIN(WS-K, 6) TO WS-I
         PERFORM PUT-ENTRY
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PB-PUT-BOOL" USING XB-BUFFER WS-REPLACE
     MOVE 0 TO XB-POS
     CALL "PROTO-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-CONN XB-BUFFER WS-PACKET
     EXIT.

 FEED-MANY.
     CALL "PB-RESET" USING XB-BUFFER
     CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING XB-BUFFER WS-COUNT
     PERFORM VARYING WS-K FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-K > WS-COUNT
         MOVE 1 TO WS-I
         PERFORM PUT-ENTRY
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "PB-PUT-BOOL" USING XB-BUFFER WS-REPLACE
     MOVE 0 TO XB-POS
     CALL "PROTO-PACKET" USING CLIENT-STATE WS-CONN XB-BUFFER WS-PACKET
     EXIT.

*> One entry of the row WS-I: the display id is the row's id, or 100 + WS-K in FEED-MANY (WS-COUNT 45, the group dropped).
 PUT-ENTRY.
     INITIALIZE XB-RECIPE-ENTRY XB-SLOT-DISPLAY-TABLE
     MOVE WS-R-ID(WS-I) TO XB-RE-DISPLAY-ID
     MOVE WS-R-TYPE(WS-I) TO XB-RE-TYPE
     MOVE WS-R-CAT(WS-I) TO XB-RE-CATEGORY
     MOVE WS-R-GROUP(WS-I) TO XB-RE-GROUP
     MOVE WS-R-W(WS-I) TO XB-RE-WIDTH
     MOVE WS-R-H(WS-I) TO XB-RE-HEIGHT
     MOVE WS-R-SLOTS(WS-I) TO XB-RE-INGREDIENT-COUNT
     IF WS-COUNT = 45
         COMPUTE XB-RE-DISPLAY-ID = 100 + WS-K
         MOVE 0 TO XB-RE-GROUP
         MOVE 0 TO XB-RE-CATEGORY
         MOVE 0 TO XB-RE-TYPE
         MOVE 1 TO XB-RE-INGREDIENT-COUNT
     END-IF
     COMPUTE XB-SDT-COUNT = XB-RE-INGREDIENT-COUNT + 2
     PERFORM VARYING WS-N FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-N > XB-RE-INGREDIENT-COUNT
         MOVE XB-SDX-ITEM TO XB-SDN-TYPE(WS-N)
         MOVE WS-R-ING(WS-I) TO XB-SDN-ITEM(WS-N)
         MOVE WS-N TO XB-RE-INGREDIENT(WS-N)
         MOVE WS-R-ING(WS-I) TO XB-RE-REQ-ITEM(WS-N)
     END-PERFORM
     COMPUTE XB-RE-RESULT = XB-RE-INGREDIENT-COUNT + 1
     COMPUTE XB-RE-STATION = XB-RE-INGREDIENT-COUNT + 2
     MOVE XB-SDX-ITEM-STACK TO XB-SDN-TYPE(XB-RE-RESULT)
     MOVE WS-R-RES(WS-I) TO XB-SDN-ITEM(XB-RE-RESULT)
     MOVE WS-R-RC(WS-I) TO XB-SDN-COUNT(XB-RE-RESULT)
     MOVE XB-SDX-EMPTY TO XB-SDN-TYPE(XB-RE-STATION)
     MOVE WS-R-REQ(WS-I) TO XB-RE-REQ-PRESENT
     MOVE XB-RE-INGREDIENT-COUNT TO XB-RE-REQ-COUNT
     MOVE WS-R-FLAGS(WS-I) TO XB-RE-FLAGS
     CALL "PB-PUT-RECIPE-ENTRY" USING XB-BUFFER XB-RECIPE-ENTRY XB-SLOT-DISPLAY-TABLE
     EXIT.

 END PROGRAM ACC-F2US9-RECIPE-BOOK.

 COPY CLTEST.
